1
00:00:00,613 --> 00:00:02,653
(Raj(internally, while Penny continues to talk):)Oh, my. She does smell good.

2
00:00:02,823 --> 00:00:05,163
What is that? Vanilla?

3
00:00:05,326 --> 00:00:06,326
You know?

4
00:00:06,493 --> 00:00:09,703
(Penny:)Where I come from, someone comes
into your house at night, you shoot.

5
00:00:09,872 --> 00:00:11,662
(Penny:)Okay? And you don't shoot to wound.

6
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:16,502
I mean, all right, my sister shot her husband,
but it was an accident, they were drunk.

7
00:00:17,171 --> 00:00:18,711
(Penny:)What was I saying?

8
00:00:18,881 --> 00:00:20,511
(Raj(internally):)She's so chatty.

9
00:00:21,675 --> 00:00:25,305
Maybe my parents were right.
Maybe I'd be better off with an Indian girl.

10
00:00:25,471 --> 00:00:27,351
(Raj(internally):)We'd have
the same cultural background...

11
00:00:27,514 --> 00:00:31,014
...and my wife could sing to my children
the lullabies my mother sang to me.

12
00:00:31,185 --> 00:00:32,605
It's obvious they meant well.

13
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,850
(Penny:)I'm having a really rough time.
Like I said...

14
00:00:35,022 --> 00:00:37,362
(Penny:)...I broke up with my boyfriend
and it's freaking me out.

15
00:00:37,524 --> 00:00:39,864
[RAJESH SINGING IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE
IN VOICE-OVER]

16
00:00:42,071 --> 00:00:45,491
(Penny:)I mean, just because most of the men
I've known happened to be jerks...

17
00:00:45,658 --> 00:00:48,658
(Penny:)...doesn't mean I should just assume
Leonard and Sheldon are.

18
00:00:48,827 --> 00:00:50,157
(Sheldon:)Right?

19
00:00:50,329 --> 00:00:53,209
(Raj(internally):)She asked me a question.
I should probably nod.

20
00:00:55,167 --> 00:00:56,587
(Penny:)That's exactly what I thought.

21
00:00:56,752 --> 00:01:00,022
(Penny:)Thank you for listening. You're a doll.

